esigner Reiner Knizia, Lost Cities VR is a two-player strategy game that transports you to unexplored regions and mythical realms. Can you outwit your opponent and make the most profit as you compete to be the first to discover the ancient lost cities?\n\nFeatures:\n\n* Multiplayer\n* VoIP\n* Matchmaking\n* Leaderboards\n* 3 Scenes:\n  - Desert Sands\n  - Himalayan Mountains\n  - Neptune's Realm", "short_description": "Based on the award-winning tabletop card game Lost Cities by world-renowned board game designer Reiner Knizia, Lost Cities VR is a two-player strategy game that transports you to unexplored regions and mythical realms. Can you outwit your opponent and make the most profit as you compete to be the first to discover the ancient lost cities?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.lostcitiesvr.com/terms-and-privacy#", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.lostcitiesvr.com/terms-and-privacy", "publisher_name": "The Campfire Union", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.lostcitiesvr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["STRATEGY", "CASUAL", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "166908339633896"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974711_227150838228420_1076974482674941952_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZAwJfQf-L3kQ7kNvwHygLex&